dica","section":"face","label":"Face","startLine":30762,"endLine":30764,"text":"Teeth very sensitive. Sharp, cutting pain\nleft side. Dryness of fauces, throat, and mouth."},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"stomach","label":"Stomach","startLine":30765,"endLine":30766,"text":"Sour eructations ; nausea."},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"throat","label":"Throat","startLine":30767,"endLine":30770,"text":"Dry mouth, throat, and fauces. Burning\nin pharynx, raw feeling in naso-pharynx, must swallow,\nthough painful."},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"abdomen","label":"Abdomen","startLine":30771,"endLine":30775,"text":"Pain around umbilicus ; spreads all over\nabdomen ; better, stool. Thin, watery stool, inter-\nmingled with hard lumps of faeces. [Ant. crudJ]\nStraining at stool; thin, dark, bloody, with tenesmus."},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"urinary","label":"Urinary","startLine":30776,"endLine":30780,"text":"Scanty, high-colored, bloody, with much\nmucus and tenesmus. Great heat and constant urging.\nNephritis. Irritable bladder of children, with head-\nache. Renal colic. [Pareira; Ocim.; Serb.]"},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"male","label":"Male","startLine":30781,"endLine":30784,"text":"Lascivious dreams, with involuntary emis-\nsions. Prostate enlarged. Dull, heavy pain in sper-\nmatic cord, extending to testicles."},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"female","label":"Female","startLine":30785,"endLine":30787,"text":"Menses retarded, suppressed. Functional\namenorrhcea of. young girls with backache. Before\nmenses, inflammatory conditions of throat, chest, and"},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"bladder","label":"bladder","startLine":30788,"endLine":30792,"text":"After menstruation commences, these im-\nprove. Anaemic dysmenorrhoea with urinary disturb-\nances. Premature and too profuse menses. [Calc.;\nFrig.]"},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"respiratory","label":"Respiratory","startLine":30793,"endLine":30798,"text":"Acute inflammatory conditions of up-\nper respiratory tract. Hoarseness. Cough loose, with\nlabored inspiration. Chest sore and raw. Dyspnoea on\nascending. [Calc.] Dry teasing cough, stitching chest\npains."},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"sleep","label":"Sleep","startLine":30799,"endLine":30801,"text":"Great drowsiness, with unpleasant dreams.\nNervousness and sleeplessness."},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"relationship","label":"Relationship","startLine":30802,"endLine":30805,"text":"Compare: Senecio Jacobcea (cerebro-\n\n674"},{"source":"05_kent_lectures","section":"bladder","label":"bladder","startLine":42521,"endLine":42540,"text":"Renal colic, the pains being so great that they produce nau-\nsea. Renal dropsy. Intense pain over right kidney, etc. The whole\nurinary tract is painful and subject to bleeding. But bleeding espe-\ncially in the absence of the menstrual flow is the feature of this rem-\nedy. Wherever there is an inflammatory spot or catarrhal condition\nof the mucous membrane it will bleed in case the menstrual flow does\nnot appear. We have other medicines having the symptoms of vica-\nrious hsemorrhage, such as Hamamelis, Phosphorus and Bryonia, but\nSenecio has this condition strikingly and is one of the newer remedies\nfor such condition.\n\n“Dysmenorrhoea with urinary symptoms ; cutting in sacral and hyjx)-\ngastric regions.” “Hacking cough at night.” “Amenon*hoea from a\ncold ; nervous irritability ; lassitude ; dropsy.” “Menstrual irregularities\nin consumptive patients.” “Mucous rattling with suppressed cough.”\n\nLeucorrhoea especially in chlorotic girls. It is a marked remedy in\nchlorosis, in the anaemic state with a green hue, called “green sickness”\nby the laity."},{"source":"12_boger_synoptic_key","section":"nose","label":"Nose","startLine":34457,"endLine":34489,"text":"Lungs.\n\nLumbar spine.\n\nWORSE:\n\nPuberty.\n\nSexual excitement.\nDampness.\n\nCold.\n\nOpen air.\n\nBETTER:\nMenstruation.\n\nLack of reaction in genito-urinary sphere. Passive congestion, with irritation, profuse catarrhs,\ndebilitating or vicarious discharges. Muscles draw into knots. Tightness, in nose, throat, etc.\nGlobus. ........cceeeeeeees Nervous, pale, weak, and sleepless women. Whining and irritable. Self-\ncentered. Elated and sad alternately. Sharp pain backward over |. eye. Burning in nostrils.\nSneezing. Itching; caused by tears; in Eustachian tube. Twitching about mouth. Averse to\nsweets. Nausea or vomiting of renal origin. Ureemia. Griping at navel. Bloody stool or urine.\nHeat in neck of bladder; with renal pain. Dysuria; with dysmenorrheea. Pains from ovaries into\nbreasts. Functional amenorrheea. Sexual irritations; excite discharges. Thick, yellow leucorrhcea;\nflows down thighs. Feels as if menses would come. Cough; tickling; with blood-streaked\nsputum; > menstruation. Burning in |. nipple. Lumbar backache, as if to break; < amenorrhea,\nrenal disease, etc. Periodical, wandering rheumatism. Many dreams; erotic. Feet cold in bed.\nBrittle nails. Hay fever, with anorexia. Sleepless with amenia."}],"corpusPassages":[]}